sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant DecryptScreen
    participant MainActivity as MainActivity<br/>cryptransfer/file
    participant SecurityLifecycleMixin
    participant ReceiverEnd as ReceiverEndSessionScreen
    participant CleanupRepository
    participant SenderTransfer as SenderTransferScreen
    participant KeyRepository
    participant EncryptionService
    participant Firestore as Firestore (transfers,<br/>auditLogs)
    participant Storage as Firebase Storage

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over User,ReceiverEnd: A) Save and Suicide (_saveAndWipe())
    User->>DecryptScreen: tap "Save" (phase: done)
    DecryptScreen->>MainActivity: saveToDownloads(fileName, decryptedBytes)
    Note right of MainActivity: API 29+: MediaStore.Downloads<br/>API <29: FileOutputStream
    DecryptScreen->>Firestore: updateReceiverStatus(transferId, 'saved')
    DecryptScreen->>DecryptScreen: decryptedBytes.fillRange(0, len, 0), set null
    DecryptScreen->>SecurityLifecycleMixin: _deleteTempFile(), wipeAll()
    Note right of SecurityLifecycleMixin: zeroes aesKey, ivBuffer, decryptedBytes
    SecurityLifecycleMixin->>SecurityLifecycleMixin: onBuffersWiped() -> delete temp file (defensive)
    DecryptScreen->>ReceiverEnd: pushReplacement(ReceiverEndSessionScreen)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over ReceiverEnd,Storage: B) Synchronized cleanup protocol (Turns 1-4)

    Note over ReceiverEnd,Firestore: Turn 1 (Receiver)
    User->>ReceiverEnd: tap "End Session"
    ReceiverEnd->>ReceiverEnd: _initiateCleanup()
    ReceiverEnd->>CleanupRepository: initiateReceiverCleanup({transferId,<br/>receiverId, senderId, senderUsername, fileName, fileSize})
    CleanupRepository->>Firestore: transfers/{transferId}.update({status:'cleanup_initiated',<br/>cleanupInitiatedAt: serverTimestamp})
    CleanupRepository->>Firestore: write receiver audit log

    ReceiverEnd->>CleanupRepository: watchTransferForDeletion(transferId)
    Note right of ReceiverEnd: 120s safety timeout (_senderWaitTimeout)<br/>falls through to _runFinalCleanup() regardless

    Note over SenderTransfer,Firestore: Turn 2 (Sender)
    SenderTransfer->>SenderTransfer: _startTransferListener() sees<br/>cleanup_initiated==true && done && !senderWipeSent
    SenderTransfer->>Firestore: senderWipeAESKey(transferId) -><br/>transfers/{transferId}.update({encryptedAESKey:'',<br/>senderCleanedUp:true, senderCleanedUpAt: serverTimestamp})
    SenderTransfer->>SenderTransfer: wipeAll() (zero encryptedBytes, aesKey)

    Note over ReceiverEnd,EncryptionService: Turn 3 (Receiver) - triggered by senderCleanedUp==true
    Firestore-->>ReceiverEnd: onTransferDocUpdate(senderCleanedUp==true,<br/>encryptedAESKey=='')
    ReceiverEnd->>ReceiverEnd: cancel timeout/listener -> _runFinalCleanup()

    rect rgb(255,255,255)
    Note over ReceiverEnd,EncryptionService: Ordered steps (security order)
    ReceiverEnd->>Firestore: Step 0: writeFinalAuditLog({senderId, receiverId,<br/>senderUsername, receiverUsername, fileName, fileSize})<br/>(batch write to both users' auditLogs, status:'completed')
    ReceiverEnd->>Storage: Step 1: deleteStorageFile(transferId)<br/>(delete transfers/{transferId}/encrypted_file)
    ReceiverEnd->>KeyRepository: Step 2: getActiveHandshakeDocId(senderUid, receiverUid)
    ReceiverEnd->>KeyRepository: endSessionCleanup({transferId, handshakeId, receiverId})
    Note right of KeyRepository: WriteBatch: delete transfers/{transferId},<br/>delete handshakes/{handshakeId},<br/>users/{receiverId}.update({selectedSenderUid: delete()})
    ReceiverEnd->>EncryptionService: Step 3: closeReceiverSession(receiverId)<br/>(full RSA session teardown - see SD014/SD015)
    end

    Note over SenderTransfer,Firestore: Turn 4 (Sender)
    Firestore-->>SenderTransfer: transfers/{transferId} doc deleted (from Step 2)
    SenderTransfer->>SenderTransfer: watchTransferStatus stream sees doc gone<br/>(done==true && !sessionEnded)
    SenderTransfer->>SenderTransfer: wipeAll()
    SenderTransfer-->>User: navigate to SenderSessionEndScreen<br/>("Receiver has securely closed the session")

    ReceiverEnd-->>User: phase=done -> 2s delay -><br/>pushAndRemoveUntil(HomeScreen)
    end

    alt 300s sender timeout (cleanup_initiated never arrives)
        SenderTransfer->>SenderTransfer: wipeAll()
        SenderTransfer-->>User: navigate to SenderSessionEndScreen<br/>(timeoutReason: "Session ended by timeout -<br/>receiver did not complete cleanup")
    end
